    "link exists, cite the same role's own posting page on the company's careers site (never the careers index) or choose another candidate. Name only one"
    ' event in each intent claim, the one that meets the signal: never add a second release, deal, opening or date,'
    " even from the same page, because Leadpoet's judge fails the whole claim when any added event is unproven. For"
    " a hiring signal cited from an Ashby or Greenhouse posting, the judge dates the posting by the job board's own"
    " first-published date, so a posting first published outside the signal's age limit fails even while it is "
    'still open: cite a posting first published inside the limit. Tool-call form, to save turns: write every date'
    " as a quoted string such as '2026-11-04'; tyche_inspect takes one of ref, target, tool, query or recover per call,"
    ' and with a company target its field names are company, account_fit, qualification_checks, signal_evidence and '
    "supporting_findings ('sources' and 'review_ref' are not company fields), and term searches only a text field; "
    "firecrawl_scrape takes onlyMainContent, not useMainContentOnly; when a lookup is refused as already "
